{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "latlon3d_advection_meridional_ppm",
    "description": "MMS driver: forced meridional advection on the 3-D latlon3d grid, u_t = -v_deg * D(u, lat) + v_deg * dPdlat, discretized by grids/latlon3d/rules/ppm_D_lat_zero_grad_bc (Piecewise Parabolic Method, Colella-Woodward 1984; conservative finite-volume, semi-discrete method-of-lines upwind flux, zero-gradient pole ghosts, rank-3). The higher-order GC-faithful counterpart of latlon3d_advection_meridional_zero_grad (same manufactured solution, same passive lon/lev, swapping the 2nd-order centered rule for PPM). PASSIVE lon (NLON=8, zonally symmetric) and PASSIVE lev (NLEV=4, level-independent). Manufactured STEADY solution u*(lat) = cos^4((pi/180) lat) with exactly matching steady forcing v_deg * dPdlat, dPdlat = -4 (pi/180) cos^3(Phi) sin(Phi), Phi = (pi/180) lat, so u_t = 0 and u(t) = u* in the continuous problem; the discrete field drifts only by spatial truncation. BC COMPATIBILITY: u* has its first three Phi-derivatives vanishing at the poles (all carry a cos factor), so the both-ends zeroth-order-extrapolation ghost residual is small and the observed order is set by the one-sided PPM boundary reconstruction -- near 2nd order in practice (like the 1-D bounded sibling advection_1d_inflow_ppm), pinned honestly in tests/conformance/convergence/latlon3d_advection_meridional_ppm (NOT a claim of 3rd order). GRID CONTRACT WIRING: NLON=8 and NLEV=4 are closed at the import edge (both passive), NLAT stays open (default 91, swept via the loader API); dlat_deg = 180/(NLAT-1) is an observed dividing by the metaparameter NAME NLAT (esm-spec 9.7.6); lat0_deg = -90. The ic, forcing, and references inline lat_j = -90 + (j-1)*180/(NLAT-1) via the NLAT name (build-time scope caveat: lat_coord is not resolvable in build-time ic/reference positions). ERROR MODEL: with v_deg=30 and t=0.2 the truncation drift falls at the pinned observed order over the NLAT ladder; per-resolution values in the convergence golden. Sign convention: v_deg >= 0 (northward); the PPM upwind reconstruction takes its parabola from the south (upwind) cells.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:problem",
      "grid:latlon3d",
      "equation:advection",
      "mms"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Roache, P. J. (2002). Code verification by the method of manufactured solutions. J. Fluids Eng. 124(1), 4-10.",
        "doi": "10.1115/1.1436090"
      },
      {
        "citation": "LeVeque, R. J. (2007). Finite Difference Methods for Ordinary and Partial Differential Equations. SIAM. Section 2.12 (boundary-compatible manufactured solutions and one-sided closures)."
      }
    ]
  },
  "models": {
    "MeridionalAdvectionPPM3d": {
      "expression_template_imports": [
        {
          "ref": "../grids/latlon3d/rules/ppm_D_lat_zero_grad_bc.esm",
          "bindings": {
            "NLON": 8,
            "NLEV": 4
          }
        }
      ],
      "variables": {
        "u": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "lon",
            "lat",
            "lev"
          ],
          "description": "Tracer over lon x lat x lev (zonally symmetric, level-independent here)."
        },
        "v_deg": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "deg/s",
          "default": 30,
          "description": "Constant meridional transport speed (deg latitude per second, positive northward). Multiplies both the discretized derivative and the forcing so the steady balance holds for any value."
        },
        "dlat_deg": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "deg",
          "description": "Meridional spacing 180/(NLAT-1): the grid's dlat_deg free name. NLAT is the document-scoped metaparameter substituted at load (esm-spec 9.7.6), so the sweep keeps it consistent."
        },
        "dPdlat": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1/deg",
          "shape": [
            "lon",
            "lat",
            "lev"
          ],
          "description": "Analytic per-degree meridional derivative of u*: -4 (pi/180) cos^3(Phi) sin(Phi). v_deg*dPdlat is the forcing that holds u*=cos^4 steady."
        }
      },
      "equations": [
        {
          "lhs": {
            "op": "ic",
            "args": [
              "u"
            ]
          },
          "rhs": {
            "op": "aggregate",
            "output_idx": [
              "i",
              "j",
              "k"
            ],
            "args": [],
            "ranges": {
              "i": {
                "from": "lon"
              },
              "j": {
                "from": "lat"
              },
              "k": {
                "from": "lev"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "^",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "cos",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "*",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "/",
                          "args": [
                            3.141592653589793,
                            180
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "op": "+",
                          "args": [
                            -90,
                            {
                              "op": "*",
                              "args": [
                                {
                                  "op": "-",
                                  "args": [
                                    "j",
                                    1
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "op": "/",
                                  "args": [
                                    180,
                                    {
                                      "op": "-",
                                      "args": [
                                        "NLAT",
                                        1
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                4
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": {
            "op": "D",
            "args": [
              "u"
            ],
            "wrt": "t"
          },
          "rhs": {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "-",
                    "args": [
                      "v_deg"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "D",
                    "args": [
                      "u"
                    ],
                    "wrt": "lat"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  "v_deg",
                  "dPdlat"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "dlat_deg",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              180,
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  "NLAT",
                  1
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "dPdlat",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "aggregate",
            "output_idx": [
              "i",
              "j",
              "k"
            ],
            "args": [],
            "ranges": {
              "i": {
                "from": "lon"
              },
              "j": {
                "from": "lat"
              },
              "k": {
                "from": "lev"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
                -4,
                {
                  "op": "/",
                  "args": [
                    3.141592653589793,
                    180
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "op": "^",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "cos",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "*",
                          "args": [
                            {
                              "op": "/",
                              "args": [
                                3.141592653589793,
                                180
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "op": "+",
                              "args": [
                                -90,
                                {
                                  "op": "*",
                                  "args": [
                                    {
                                      "op": "-",
                                      "args": [
                                        "j",
                                        1
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "op": "/",
                                      "args": [
                                        180,
                                        {
                                          "op": "-",
                                          "args": [
                                            "NLAT",
                                            1
                                          ]
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    3
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "op": "sin",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "*",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "/",
                          "args": [
                            3.141592653589793,
                            180
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "op": "+",
                          "args": [
                            -90,
                            {
                              "op": "*",
                              "args": [
                                {
                                  "op": "-",
                                  "args": [
                                    "j",
                                    1
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "op": "/",
                                  "args": [
                                    180,
                                    {
                                      "op": "-",
                                      "args": [
                                        "NLAT",
                                        1
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "id": "mms_steady_meridional_ppm_3d",
          "description": "Manufactured steady u*(lat)=cos^4((pi/180) lat), v_deg=30, independent of lon and lev. Continuous balance u_t = -v u*_lat + v u*_lat = 0; the discrete PPM field drifts only by spatial truncation. t=0 pins ic wiring; t=0.2 bounds the drift (bound set from the convergence golden's coarsest point); the max assertion (u*=1 at the equator row for odd NLAT) guards a uniform-shift/forcing-sign defect. Per-resolution errors in the convergence golden.",
          "time_span": {
            "start": 0.0,
            "end": 0.2
          },
          "assertions": [
            {
              "variable": "u",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "tolerance": {
                "abs": 1e-09
              },
              "reduce": "L2_error",
              "reference": {
                "op": "aggregate",
                "output_idx": [
                  "i",
                  "j",
                  "k"
                ],
                "args": [],
                "ranges": {
                  "i": {
                    "from": "lon"
                  },
                  "j": {
                    "from": "lat"
                  },
                  "k": {
                    "from": "lev"
                  }
                },
                "expr": {
                  "op": "^",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "cos",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "*",
                          "args": [
                            {
                              "op": "/",
                              "args": [
                                3.141592653589793,
                                180
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "op": "+",
                              "args": [
                                -90,
                                {
                                  "op": "*",
                                  "args": [
                                    {
                                      "op": "-",
                                      "args": [
                                        "j",
                                        1
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "op": "/",
                                      "args": [
                                        180,
                                        {
                                          "op": "-",
                                          "args": [
                                            "NLAT",
                                            1
                                          ]
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    4
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "u",
              "time": 0.2,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "tolerance": {
                "abs": 0.02
              },
              "reduce": "L2_error",
              "reference": {
                "op": "aggregate",
                "output_idx": [
                  "i",
                  "j",
                  "k"
                ],
                "args": [],
                "ranges": {
                  "i": {
                    "from": "lon"
                  },
                  "j": {
                    "from": "lat"
                  },
                  "k": {
                    "from": "lev"
                  }
                },
                "expr": {
                  "op": "^",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "cos",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "*",
                          "args": [
                            {
                              "op": "/",
                              "args": [
                                3.141592653589793,
                                180
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "op": "+",
                              "args": [
                                -90,
                                {
                                  "op": "*",
                                  "args": [
                                    {
                                      "op": "-",
                                      "args": [
                                        "j",
                                        1
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "op": "/",
                                      "args": [
                                        180,
                                        {
                                          "op": "-",
                                          "args": [
                                            "NLAT",
                                            1
                                          ]
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    4
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "u",
              "time": 0.2,
              "expected": 1.0,
              "tolerance": {
                "abs": 0.05
              },
              "reduce": "max"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
